timestamp=2026-11-14T20:57:43.300Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Compare filling Window 2 (+80 kH-mo avg) and Window 3 (+300 kH-mo avg) via:\n# A) Buy Gen H now (m1): $25M/1k, usable m4..23 (20 mos).\n#    Salvage m24: 0.75 * 25 * 0.96^24 * 0.5 = 3.52M. Net capex = 21.48M + ~3.3M interest + 24*0.168(ap power)=4.03 => 28.81M / 20mos = $1.44/kH-mo!\n#    Wait: what if bought at m1 to ap? Needs ap power (signed m1, energises m3..7 -> avg m5, usable m5..23 = 19 mos => 28.81/19 = $1.52/kH-mo).\n# B) Reserve 12m/24m cloud at index ~1.641:\n#    In ap (0.95x): 12m = 1.559/mo, 24m = 1.403/mo (m2..25 -> 22/24 useful = 1.531/mo).\n#    In us (1.00x): 12m = 1.641/mo, 24m = 1.477/mo (m2..25 -> 22/24 useful = 1.611/mo).\n# C) Options: $1.0M + 6 * $1.6M = $10.6M / 6 = $1.767/kH-mo (useful anytime, outside caps!).\n# D) Wait for Gen N (say launch m12, usable m15..23):\n#    Gen N costs $20M/kH, salvage m24 = 0.75 * 20 * 0.96^12 = 9.19M -> net capex 10.81M + power 24*0.12*0.8=2.30M + int~1.0 = $14.11M / 9 mos = $1.57/kH-mo!\n#    Wait: if launch is m15 (usable m18..23 = 6 mos): net capex = 20 - 0.75*20*0.96^9 = 9.61 + 2.30 + 0.7 = $12.61M / 6 mos = $2.10/kH-mo!\n#    AND Gen N CANNOT help Window 2 (m8..15) if launch is m13..15!\n\nfor launch_m in [9, 12, 15]:\n    usable = 24 - (launch_m + 3)\n    salv = 0.75 * 20 * (0.96 ** (24 - launch_m))\n    pwr = 24 * 0.12 * 0.8\n    intr = 20 * 0.0075 * usable\n    cost = (20 - salv + pwr + intr) / usable\n    print(f\"Gen N launch m{launch_m} -> usable m{launch_m+3}..23 ({usable} mos): cost = ${cost:.2f}M/kH-mo (capex-salv={20-salv:.2f}, pwr={pwr:.2f})\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
