timestamp=2026-11-14T20:59:45.250Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Compare what to do when us (10 MW) and eu (6 MW) expire at end of month 19 (affecting m20..23 = 4 months):\n# Note: in m20..23 (4 months), existing 10k H in us (needs 14 MW; us still has 6 MW = 4.28k H powered!)\n# Wait! us has 16 MW total (10 MW expires m19, 6 MW stays through m28!).\n# So after m19: us STILL has 6 MW (powers 4.28k H), eu has 0 MW (powers 0k H), ap has 26 MW (powers 18k H, 0.8 MW spare!).\n# Unpowered at m20..23 if no new power: 5.72k H in us + 4.00k H in eu = 9.72k H (38.88 kH-mos in m20..23).\n\n# Option 1: Sign 8 MW in us + 6 MW in eu (14 MW total) to keep those 9.72k H powered for m20..23:\npwr_us = 24 * 8 * 0.15  # $28.8M for 5.72k * 4 = 22.88 kH-mo -> $1.26/kH-mo!\npwr_eu = 24 * 6 * 0.20  # $28.8M for 4.00k * 4 = 16.00 kH-mo -> $1.80/kH-mo!\nprint(f\"Keep Gen H m20..23: us power=${pwr_us:.1f}M ($1.26/kH-mo), eu power=${pwr_eu:.1f}M ($1.80/kH-mo)\")\n\n# Option 2: Don't renew us/eu power for Gen H; instead resell unpowered Gen H at m19..20 (cap 3k/mo -> m19: 3k, m20: 3k, m21: 3k)\n# Salvage at m20 = 0.75 * 25 * 0.96^20 * 0.5 = $4.14M/1k vs salvage at m24 = $3.52M/1k -> gain $0.62M/1k!\n# And replace that 38.88 kH-mo in m20..23 with:\n# - 6m cloud reservation placed m17 (runs m18..23, 0 post-23 overhang!) after Gen N -25% launch drop!\n#   If index drops from ~1.50 to ~1.12 at launch: 6m = 1.12 * 1.15 = $1.29/kH-mo (us) or $1.42/kH-mo (eu)!\n#   Even at index 1.25: 6m = $1.44 (us) or $1.58 (eu) -- CHEAPER than $1.80 eu power ALONE (and us $1.26 power vs $1.29 cloud)!\n# - OR Option 3: Buy Gen N at launch m13 (usable m16..23 = 8 mos) in ap ($0.12/MW-mo, 0.8 MW/kH -> 24*0.8*0.12 = $2.30M/kH over 8 mos = $0.29/kH-mo power!)\n#   Wait: Gen N capex-salvage = 20 - 0.75*20*0.96^11 = 20 - 9.57 = $10.43M / 8 = $1.30/kH-mo + $0.29 power = $1.59/kH-mo!\nprint(\"6m cloud at post-launch idx 1.12: us=$1.29/kH-mo, eu=$1.42/kH-mo, ap=$1.22/kH-mo (0 overhang!)\")\nprint(\"Gen N at launch m13 (m16..23) in ap: $1.59/kH-mo + interest (~$1.70/kH-mo)\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
