timestamp=2026-11-14T21:01:45.160Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Current cash: $106.8M (+$40M/mo -> ~$136M at m15, ~$166M at m16, etc., plus $500M credit line!)\n# Let's model Window 3 (m16..23) under 8% always (538.6 kH-mo needed) vs switch at m14/15 (495..505 kH-mo needed):\n# Base existing: 248 kH-mo (m16..19: us 10 + eu 4 + ap 18 + ap 1 res + eu 1 res? Wait! eu 1 res m14..19 adds +4 in m16..19 -> 252 kH-mo!)\n# Plus Gen N ordered (7k = 14 kH):\n#   - If TIGHT (1.5k/mo = 3 kH/mo) across m16..20:\n#     m16: 3, m17: 6, m18: 9, m19: 12, m20: 14, m21: 14, m22: 14, m23: 14 => 86 kH-mo!\n#   - If LOOSE (4k/mo = 8 kH/mo) across m16..17:\n#     m16: 8, m17..23: 14 * 7 = 98 => 106 kH-mo!\n# Total with existing + 7k N = 252 + 86..106 = 338..358 kH-mo!\n# Still short in Window 3:\n#   - Under 8% always (539 kH-mo): short 181 to 201 kH-mo!\n#   - Under switch m14 (496 kH-mo): short 138 to 158 kH-mo!\n# Look at Options (max 20 bought per month!):\n#   - Exercised at m15 (m16..21 = 6 mos): each 1 kH adds 6 kH-mo to W3!\n#   - Exercised at m17 (m18..23 = 6 mos): each 1 kH adds 6 kH-mo to W3!\n#   - Wait: what about m22..23 (last 2 months) vs m16..17 (first 2 months)?\n#     If we exercise X kH at m15 (m16..21) and Y kH at m17 (m18..23):\n#     m16..17 get X, m18..21 get X+Y, m22..23 get Y!\n#     Check site inference in m16..23 under 8% always:\n#       us (has 10k H + ~1k N): inf grows 10.3 (m16) -> 12.0 (m18) -> 15.0 (m21) -> 17.6 (m23)!\n#         So us needs +1..2 in m16..17, +4..5 in m18..21, +6..8 in m22..23!\n#       eu (has 4k H + 1k res in m16..19 = 5k; then 0k in m20..23!!):\n#         eu inf grows 6.2 (m16) -> 7.2 (m18) -> 8.4 (m20) -> 10.6 (m23)!\n#         So eu needs +2 in m16..17, +3..4 in m18..19, +9..11 in m20..23!\n#       ap (has 18k H + 1k res + 12k H/N = 31 kH): inf is only 4.1 -> 7.0 kH (fully covered!).\n#     And total capacity across sites needs +180..200 kH-mo -> that's ~30..33 kH of 6-month Options (or Options + Cloud)!\nprint(\"Shortfall in W3 (after existing 252 + 7k N 86..106): 138..201 kH-mo -> ~23..34 kH of 6-month contracts/options!\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
