timestamp=2026-11-14T21:03:13.344Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Check Window 3 training math for m19..23 carefully!\n# Done through m18: 125.14 / 320 -> remaining = 194.86 kH-mo!\n# Inference demand: m18=20.21. Suppose 4% growth from m18=20.21 (or 8% with noisy m17-18? Wait: check both!):\n# What if growth is STILL 8% and m17=20.08, m18=20.21 were just -10% noise?!\n#   6.0 * 1.08^18 = 23.98 (-15.7% noise -> 20.21! Unlikely since noise is ~5%!).\n#   Whereas 4% switch at m15: 17.90 * 1.04^3 = 20.13 (actual 20.21!! +0.4% error!).\n#   Still, let's check BOTH 4% (20.21 * 1.04^t) AND conservative upper bound (say 22 at m19 growing 6%/yr)!\ninf_4 = [20.21 * (1.04 ** t) for t in range(1, 6)] # m19..23\ninf_hi = [21.5 * (1.06 ** t) for t in range(1, 6)] # very conservative upper bound\nprint(\"m19..23 inf (4%):\", [round(x, 2) for x in inf_4], \"sum=\", round(sum(inf_4), 1))\nprint(\"m19..23 inf (hi):\", [round(x, 2) for x in inf_hi], \"sum=\", round(sum(inf_hi), 1))\n\n# Base capacity WITHOUT any resale (with #8 0.38k N arriving m20 -> ap N=6k):\n# m19: us=24.0, eu=20.0, ap=38.24 -> 82.24\n# m20..21: us=24.0, eu=15.0, ap=39.00 -> 78.00 * 2 = 156.0\n# m22..23: us=20.0, eu=11.0, ap=32.00 -> 63.00 * 2 = 126.0\n# Total m19..23 = 82.24 + 156 + 126 = 364.24!\n# Minus inf_4 (114.2) = 250.0 training (vs 194.9 needed -> +55.1 SURPLUS!)\n# Minus inf_hi (129.0) = 235.2 training (vs 194.9 needed -> +40.3 SURPLUS!)\n\n# Now suppose we resell:\n# m19: 3k H from eu (saves 0.96*3 = $2.9M! loses 3*5 = 15 kH-mo)\n# m20: 1k H from eu (was unpowered anyway! loses 0 kH-mo!) + 2k H from ap (loses 2*4 = 8 kH-mo)\n# m21: 3k H from ap (loses 3*3 = 9 kH-mo)\n# Total kH-mo lost = 15 + 8 + 9 = 32 kH-mo -> still +23 kH-mo surplus (4% inf) or +8 kH-mo (hi inf)!\n# Wait: even safer, keep m19 powered (only lose 0 at m19? Wait: resell 3k H eu at m19 loses only 3*1=3 kH-mo because eu 6MW expires at m19 anyway!!)\n# OH!! eu 4k H ONLY had 1 month of power left (m19)!! So reselling 3k H eu at m19 loses ONLY 3 kH-mo, and 1k H eu at m20 loses ZERO kH-mo!!\nprint(\"Reselling 3k H eu at m19 loses ONLY 3 kH-mo -> surplus still +52 (4%) or +37 (hi)!!\")\nprint(\"Plus at m20: 1k H eu (0 loss) + 2k H ap (-8 kH-mo); at m21: 3k H ap (-9 kH-mo) -> total loss 20 kH-mo -> surplus +35 (4%) or +20 (hi)!\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
