timestamp=2026-11-14T21:03:30.985Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Remaining training needed at start of m20: 136.47 kH-mo\n# Inference m20..23 at 4% from m19=20.86 (even with +5% upper noise buffer!):\n#   20.86 * [1.04, 1.0816, 1.1249, 1.1699] = [21.69, 22.56, 23.46, 24.40] -> sum = 92.11!\n#   With extreme +5% on all 4 months: 96.7!\n# Capacity without any resales (except eu 1k H which is unpowered!):\n#   m20: 78.0, m21: 78.0, m22: 63.0, m23: 63.0 -> sum = 282.0!\n#   Training surplus above 136.47 + 92.11 = 282.0 - 228.58 = +53.4 kH-mo!\n#   Even with +5% inf (96.7): +48.8 kH-mo surplus!\n\n# Wait: what if we resell:\n#   m20: resell 1k H eu (0 kH-mo lost!) + 2k H ap (-8 kH-mo) + 2k N ap (-16 kH-mo) -> total lost = 24 kH-mo!\n#        Wait: let's check remaining surplus after -24 kH-mo: +29.4 kH-mo!\n#        Check ap site capacity after -2k H and -2k N: ap was 39 -> becomes 33 (in m20..21) and 26 (in m22..23), vs ap inf = 4.3..4.9!\n#   m21: resell 3k N ap (-18 kH-mo) -> wait: -24 - 18 = -42 kH-mo! Remaining surplus = +11.4 kH-mo!\n#        Better: resell 2k N ap at m21 (-12 kH-mo, leaving +17.4 kH-mo) AND wait to see m20 & m21 actuals before m22..23 resales!\n#   Wait: check m20 resell 3k N ap (-24 kH-mo) vs 2k N ap (-16 kH-mo)!\n#     If m20: resell 1k H eu (0 lost!) + 2k H ap (-8) + 2k N ap (-16) = 24 lost -> leaves +29.4 surplus!\n#     Wait: at m20, why resell 2k H ap (-8 for $1.48M) if we can resell 3k N ap (-24 for $12.24M!!) instead of 2k H ap?!\n#     YES!! Look at that:\n#       At m20: resell 1k H eu (0 lost, +$4.15M cash!) AND resell 3k N ap (-24 kH-mo lost, +$67.6M cash -> saves $12.2M!)!\n#       Remaining surplus after m20 = 53.4 - 24 = +29.4 kH-mo!\n#       Check ap site capacity after -3k N (6 kH): m20..21 ap = 33, m22..23 ap = 26 (vs ap inf ~4.5..5.0 -> huge!)\n#       Then at m21: check actual m20 training, and resell 1k..2k N ap (-6..-12 kH-mo) + 3k H ap!\n#       Then at m22 & m23: resell remaining 1k..2k N ap and 3k H/mo!\nprint(\"At m20: resell 1k H eu (0 lost!) + 3k N ap (-24 kH-mo) -> leaves ~+29 kH-mo buffer and saves ~$12.9M!\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
