timestamp=2026-11-14T21:03:46.903Z level=INFO run=6ee92965 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 - << 'EOF'\n# Remaining training at m21: 86.02 kH-mo\n# Inference m21, m22, m23 from m20=21.55 at 4%/mo:\ninf = [21.55 * 1.04, 21.55 * 1.04**2, 21.55 * 1.04**3] # [22.41, 23.31, 24.24]\nprint(\"inf m21..23:\", [round(x, 2) for x in inf], \"sum=\", round(sum(inf), 2))\n# With +5% worst-case noise on ALL 3 months: 73.5! (Normal max ~71.5)\n# Current capacity WITHOUT resales:\n#   m21: 72.0 (us 24, eu 15, ap 33)\n#   m22: 57.0 (us 20, eu 11, ap 26)\n#   m23: 57.0 (us 20, eu 11, ap 26)\n#   Total = 72 + 57 + 57 = 186.0 kH-mo!\n#   Minus inf (69.96) = 116.04 training vs 86.02 needed => +30.02 SURPLUS!!\n#   Even with +5% inf (73.5): +26.5 SURPLUS!!\n\n# Now look at reselling Gen N & Gen H in m21, m22, m23:\n# Remember: 1k Gen N = 2 kH!\n# If at m21 we resell 2k N ap (-4 kH * 3 mos = -12 kH-mo, leaves +18 surplus -> +14.5 even with +5% inf!):\n#   Wait: let's check ap site capacity after -2k N (4 kH): m21 ap = 29, m22..23 ap = 22 (vs ap inf ~4.5..5.0 -> huge!)\n#   Wait: can we ALSO resell 1k N ap at m22 (-4 kH-mo) and 3k N? Wait: we have 3k N in ap + 1k N in us (note: us has 20 in m22..23 vs us inf ~11.7..12.1, so we shouldn't touch us N if we keep buffer, or us N 1k at m23!).\n#   And what about Gen H?\n#     If at m21 we resell 2k N ap (-12 kH-mo) + 2k H ap (-6 kH-mo) = -18 kH-mo -> leaves +12 kH-mo surplus!\n#     Even safer: at m21 resell 2k N ap (-12 kH-mo) -> leaves +18 surplus!\n#     Then at m22 (when m21 actuals are known, and ONLY m22..23 remain!):\n#       At m22, m21 training will be ~234 + (68 - 22.4) = ~279.6 / 320 (~40.4 left for m22..23!!)!\n#       And m22+m23 capacity (with 1k N left in ap + 1k N in us) = 53 + 53 = 106, minus 47.5 inf = 58.5 (~+18 surplus!!)!\n#       So at m22 we can resell remaining 1k N ap (-4 kH-mo) + 3k H ap (-6 kH-mo) -> -10 kH-mo, STILL leaving +8 kH-mo surplus!\n#       And at m23 (only 1 month left!) we can resell any remaining surplus (3k H + up to 1k N if safe) once m22 actuals lock in 320!\nprint(\"Plan: m21 resell 2k N ap (-12 kH-mo, +$43.3M cash, leaves +18 surplus); m22 resell 1k N ap + 3k H ap; m23 resell final surplus!\")\nEOF" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
